# Citation metadata for this repository (Citation File Format).
# GitHub reads this file and shows a "Cite this repository" button.
# Because "preferred-citation" is set, that button gives the paper, not the code.

cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper listed under
  "preferred-citation".
type: software
title: "Excero"
abstract: >-
  Research platform used in a six-month randomized controlled trial on
  physical activity with human peers and AI-driven simulated exercising
  peers. It consists of an iOS mobile app, a Django backend and Go
  components.
# Authors of the software. Add anyone else who wrote code for the platform.
